loop `sequential_generatedRoot_769`, the last in the root, and the ModDown to the terminal
modulus `Q1`, where the plaintext is `⌊Q1/2⌋ (-1)^⌊z/128⌋ τ(z mod 128)` against the gadget `1`.
-/

